WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.660
Arashi and Hajime joined their hands together but...

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.630
... the energy bounced off their palms.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.990
The two slowly join their hands.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.110
But nothing happened.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.630
Did you guys...

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.660
It seems like I can't fly.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.220
Showa Blues

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.900
- Um. Can I get some salt? 
- Yes, sir.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:16.040
- Salt! 
- Arashiyama senpai! That's sugar!

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:20.280
Woops. I was being careless. Sorry, sorry.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.320
Sorry, Yayoi-chan.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:29.360
- Hajime? 
 - Oh it's hot!

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.260
- What happened?! 
- I'm sorry!

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.480
What's wrong, Hajime? 
- You've been careless today.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:39.490
- I'm sorry.
- Don't worry about this. Go change.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.370
Kaya-san can I have a minute?

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:50.540
Hajime got rejected by Arashi?!

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:55.380
- You're being too loud, Kaya-san! 
- Is that the reason they can't fly?!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:03:00.160
- Probably. 
- Oh, how shameful!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.730
- Are you really a man?! 
- Kaya-san you're being too loud!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:09.240
You can't cooperate with her because you got rejected?! That's it, right?

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:12.840
I don't intend it to be like that.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.410
We were wondering too. That's why, huh?

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:20.130
So a silly dispute, huh?

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:23.930
- Kanako-san.
- A kid that can't even take care of himself...

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:27.810
...trying to get romantically involved? How annoying!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:31.250
Hey, don't look down at me because I'm a kid! I'm serious!

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:35.900
If it affects your work we have to pay the price! Shake it off already!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.200
If you can't do that, then you're still a kid.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:42.590
- It's not that easy! 
- You guys are too loud!

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:48.290
Feelings like this can't be understood by a cold hearted woman like you!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:52.910
You're trying to take it out on me. 
Now I see your true character!

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:56.000
Shut up! What right do you have saying that?!

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.070
Um, can I get some sal...

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:05.500
- Master, it's too loud! 
 - It's my favorite song.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:10.620
- Can I get some salt! 
- Oh, Arashi. Can you water the plants outside?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.900
- But...
- I'll take care of everything here.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.520
- Hurry. 
- Alright.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.330
What a pain to handle.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:30.280
<i>The two forces may attract at times and repel at times.</i>

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:33.180
<i>If you're not prepared, you'll end up getting hurt.</i>

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.870
You moping around---how shameful!

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.440
It's not something that I said light heartedly to be able to just shake it off!

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:45.660
You're right. It's shameful if you get rejected and just forget it.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:48.020
- Right.
- But, Hajime.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.810
Not connecting with someone from a single downfall.

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:54.650
Doesn't that mean you were only looking after your own interest?

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:04.930
My heart is rejecting Hajime-chan?!

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:10.160
- I love you Arashi-san! I'm serious! 
- Hajime-chan!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:12.420
Don't say anymore. I'm sorry.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:19.400
If I really fall in love, it'll be painful.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.810
It's exactly as Kaya-san and Kanako said.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.160
I have nothing to say.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:38.100
I'm stuck in a rut. How shameful.

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:43.290
It's like they said, I'm just a kid.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:48.830
I might have grand statements to make but I'm not able to back them up.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.720
I can't think of anything!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.390
What? What is this?

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.400
- Oh? 
- Yayoi-san! What are you doing here?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:15.360
I was surprised. I didn't know you were good at video games!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.900
I'm not good at modern things in general but...

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:23.390
...being secluded so long, I got good at playing games.

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:28.200
Were you searching for me?

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:31.900
Yes, along with Kanako.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:38.490
She might seem harsh, but she worries about you a lot.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.770
Is that so. I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:48.330
I came up with an idea.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:54.160
It might help you out. You want to try it?

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:08.910
I apologize. It wouldn't have happened if it wasn't for me.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:13.790
Don't worry about it. 
 Failures and growth in youth...

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:18.020
... are like they say, fortune and misfortune are always side by side. It's better to experience it earlier in life.

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:21.650
-But...
- It's probably harder for Arashi.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.270
Thinking too deeply gets you in that rut.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:28.530
It's not like Arashi never had guys around her, right?

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.590
She doesn't have a single memory with a guy?

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.690
Memory with a man?

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.720
Love is just an extension of that.

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.980
You just have to think of it lightly.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.840
That's it! Jun, come with me!

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:47.170
- What is it?! 
- Come.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.060
Why didn't she explain it to me?

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:07.940
I get it. It's because Hajime and Arashi are apart in age...

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:10.740
...that's why he's not able to understand her.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:17.910
If you guys are the same age you'll be able to understand each other.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.110
Same age? 
 How?

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:23.510
We're going to go meet her when
 she was younger using time traveling.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:27.690
- Arashi-san when she was younger?! 
- It's up to you Hajime-san.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:34.950
- Let's go Yayoi-san!
- Gladly!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:45.400
- We're going to go after them. 
- Make sure you pay me later.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:55.430
I guess it's alright, since they explained it.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.140
- Where are we? 
- The year 1940.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.930
During the war in the Showa period huh? Wait it's before the war?

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.240
The World War was in 1939.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:19.580
It just started last year. The Greater East Asian War that Japan gets involved in...

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.700
...started in 1941, which would be next year.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:26.970
It just seems like an ordinary day here.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.030
Where's the Arashi-san of this period?

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.320
Let's try going to her house first.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:36.430
I don't know if it'll be successful even with the age being closer.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:39.800
I'm worried if he'll be able to be a gentleman to her.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:45.510
What! Don't wet your pants when you see what I can do!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.330
This is it.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:53.370
Wow! That's a big house!

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.920
It's expected for a girl that goes to an all girls high school.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:10:00.160
Arashiyama-senpai came from a pretty wealthy family even among us.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:03.190
A girl from the upper class of society, huh?

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:07.330
She might not be able to mingle with peasants like us.

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:12.420
Hajime! Go and show them what you're made of! Oh, he's scared already.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.430
There's too much of a gap between us!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:19.080
Um, why don't we go back? We didn't even set an appointment with her.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:22.270
What appointment! What the hell are you saying?!

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:27.010
It's impossible! What am I suppose to talk about with a girl that comes from such a big house?!

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:32.560
- Why are you scared! Show me how much of a man you are! 
- Go for it Hajime-san!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:36.630
Aren't you going to surprise Kanako with what you can do and make her wet her pants?!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:40.710
- I'm not going to wet my pants! 
- I'm about to wet my pants!

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:45.200
- Stop talking about wetting your pants! 
- Dear lady!

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:51.730
- Where are you going?! 
- I'm going for a long ride!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:56.250
No, you may not! 
 Master Rintaro will scold you!

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:59.600
- What's all the commotion about? 
- Go peek in there.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:03.610
- Me? - Shut up and go. - Wait! I'm not ready yet!

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:16.740
You, right there! Stop her from going!

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.030
- That's...
- Arashiyama-senpai?!

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:30.890
Natsuno Arashi

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:41.650
Hajime!

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:46.900
Are you trying to stop me? How fun.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.250
I'm going to die.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:54.740
Don't touch me there pervert!

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:59.960
- If I fall, I'll get hurt! 
- I don't care! You just appeared out of nowhere!

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:04.330
- I was about to get run over! 
- It's your fault for jumping out!

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:09.170
What! That's all you have to say?!
 I'm going to touch your butt!

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:14.070
- Don't get in my way! I have places to go to! 
- Where?! - To a fight!

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:20.450
- Ken-bo!
- Hey, Arashi!

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:23.850
Jinbei is scoping them out right now. 
They're at the shrine.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.800
- Pass me some weapons. 
- Alright!

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.820
What is this fight you're talking about?

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:31.720
My friend got caught by some hoodlums.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.970
The perpetrators are hoodlums that call themselves "The Darkness Clan."

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:41.410
- A elementary school hoodlum? 
- It's no joke! "Finger Chopper" Yamamoto...

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:46.090
....his dad is a Captain in the Imperial Army. The parents can't do anything about it.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:50.670
The kids are all afraid of what he might do, so they just take it.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:55.360
<i>How cute with the "Darkness Clan" and "Finger Chopper."</i>

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:58.700
<i>Arashi-san was really immature back then.</i>

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:04.560
- Alright. I'll help you in your fight.
- What?

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:08.260
I'm known in my neighborhood for my scuffles.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:13.610
Leave it up to me! 
 <i>It feels good to be able to act tough in front of Arashi-san.</i>

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:18.160
- Arashi, thanks for waiting. 
- Alright, I'm going to leave this up to you.

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:22.110
Leave it up to me!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:30.680
They're inside here. We're going to enter from the rear.

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.030
...haha what's wrong...

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:36.800
There they are!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.490
You won't be able to tell on your parents like that!

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:45.620
There's a reason why we tax you!

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:50.820
I'm trying to be considerate for those that can't protect themselves.

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:55.210
We're trying to spread the wealth here so everyone can live equally!

00:13:55.340 --> 00:14:01.170
A selfish person like you can't understand the importance of self governance.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:05.150
What's up with that face? Are you hungry?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:10.470
- We have no food to give to a dissenter like you! 
- Here eat some dirt!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.810
- Here slurp it up!
 - You!

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:19.680
- What's going on!
- It's Arashi!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.770
- Arashi.
- It's alright. Don't worry.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:30.440
Jinbei is waiting for you at the bottom. 
 Don't fall off.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:34.040
Arashi---I'm frustrated.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:42.290
- You! 
- Eat this!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.800
- She's vicious!
-Surround her! - You stupid girl!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:57.230
Don't think you'll be the hero forever!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:01.820
- Her comrade?! 
- It's him! Get him!

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.740
- What is that?! 
- Get him!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.270
Is that "Finger Chopper?"

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:32.080
You can't be playing around like that!

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:41.220
- You won't be able to get him! 
- Shut up!

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:52.880
My intuition tells me. Arashi-san doesn't get hurt in the past.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:57.470
I'm here to save her!

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:02.760
- Do you want to have your fingers chopped off? 
- I might get hurt here...

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:04.990
...but...

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:17.630
I can see everything in slow motion.
It must be the adrenaline.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:22.150
I was like this when I got run over by that bike.

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:42.220
I'm a third degree in Kendo.

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:46.110
You guys got it! 
 Do something like this again...

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:50.980
... and I'll cut all your fingers off! 
 <i>I'll never do this again though.</i>

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:57.640
- You're a third degree in Kendo? 
- It's a lie.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:02.230
Can't you tell me where you live?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:07.260
- It's this circumstance that I'm in. 
- A circumstance that you can't even reveal your name?

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:13.690
There's a lot of things. Don't mind it too much. I'll see you soon.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:17.900
- Soon?
- In about 70 years?

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:23.510
- I'm going to be a grandma! 
- No, I think you'll still be young.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:26.910
What is it?

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:31.980
- What are you doing? 
- I'm going to borrow this. I'll return it next time I see you.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:35.640
I guess. She does things the way she wants to.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:41.920
Alright, I'll let you borrow something of mine too. Then it'll be even.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.830
What are you going to let me borrow?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:56.700
Return it to me when you see me next. 
 On the lips would be fine too.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.500
Hey!

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:03.770
Hey, Sayoko!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.030
You were home, brother?!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:15.200
Brother?! 
 What a scary face!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:15.300
Arashiyama Rintaro Age: 26 Japanese Imperial Navy Major 100th Degree in Fighting!!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:19.060
Not conscious of yourself as an Arashiyama family member shamelessly...

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:25.140
- ...involving yourself in an amorous affair in broad day light.  
- I'm going to die this time! - Way to go!

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:31.000
That's my sister, how eccentric!

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:38.840
Finally! Love is in the air for a violent, selfish, dumb, unyielding to losing, and boyish sister!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.050
- Brother! 
- I welcome you!

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:47.860
Young man. She might be a little rough around the edges but take care of her.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:52.860
- Yes, sir. - I can't hear you!
- Yes, sir! - Go away!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:57.160
- Oh, your friends are waiting in my room! 
- You should have mentioned that earlier!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:07.700
- I'll see you again! 
- See you!

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:17.830
- Wow, I was nervous for a minute. 
- I'm sorry. I mean for it to be like this.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:21.780
I was really annoyed by Arashi's brother.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:25.700
Hey, Hajime. Did you learn something useful?

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:32.520
- What?! What happened! 
- Nothing.  - Don't lie to me!

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:36.310
- Did you get dumb from the beating you took? 
- Did you hit your head?

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:40.380
- It's an emergency! You have to lay down! 
- I told you, it's nothing!

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:50.670
When did you become so feminine.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:55.260
This box. It should have been gone in the air raid! But why is it here?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:20:00.870
- We retrieved it from our time travelling. 
- You told me during the war.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:06.570
There's a special item from the boy that helped you when you were young.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:11.410
You were able to turn the tables on a fight you thought you were going to lose.

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:17.170
With the boy that never told you his name. You told it to me like it was a novel.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.680
But, I thought that wasn't the whole truth.

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:24.920
Arashi, weren't you already in love?

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:31.130
It's hard to let go of past loves,
 but it's sad not to move on from it.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:36.480
You already experienced love.
 Don't think of it that hard.

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:42.050
- Just think like the people nowadays. Wait. 
- What's wrong Kaya-san?

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:45.050
I've seen this somewhere---

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:48.930
- Isn't this...
- This is Hajime-chan's!

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:51.900
Right! This was from when Kanako-san...

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.590
...broke this when she turned into the maid warrior!

00:20:55.590 --> 00:21:01.230
- So, your first love was...
- NO WAY!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:08.400
- What's up. Come in if you're back. 
- Um, but...

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:10.240
What's wrong?

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:23.460
What happened to your face, Hajime-chan?

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:28.020
- Oh, what are those glasses for Arashi-san? 
- Huh?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:43.500
- Arashi-san, when are we flying back to? 
- Any time period!

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:51.210
- They were able to connect again.
- Now it's back to normal.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:57.870
Oh, that's right. If they're going to go back I should have told them to get my clams.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:59.860
The End.

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:36.010
- When I mention sword fighting.... 
- Musashi Miyamoto, Kurama-tengu, Tangesasen, and Hatamoto Taikutsuotoko!

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:41.870
- Wow you're so knowledgeable! What's your best move? 
- Moroha style Seigan Kuzushi!

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:44.420
Wake up early tomorrow!
